      "content": "TL 10 NW                    ST MICHAEL           POTTERSCROUCH LANE                                                  (north west side)                                                  POTTERS CROUCH 9/296                                            Barn immediately N of                                                  farmhouse at Windridge                                                  Farm GV                                               II Barn.  Later C17.  Timber frame.  Weatherboarded.  Plain tile roof.  C19 slate-roof lean-to with 4 horizontal sashes.  Interior is 6 bays.  Clasped purlin roof construction with diagonal braces from ties to purlins.  Continuous mid-height rail.  Curved  wind braces.  Some C18/19 restoration. Listing NGR: TL1242605778"
    }
